  ],
  "rationale": "<p>The correct answer is <math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math>. The left-hand side of the given equation can be factored as <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 7 x plus 8 right parenthesis left parenthesis x minus 4 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Therefore, the given equation, <math alttext=\"7 x squared minus 20 x minus 32 equals 0\"><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, can be written as <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 7 x plus 8 right parenthesis left parenthesis x minus 4 right parenthesis equals 0\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. Applying the zero product property to this equation yields <math alttext=\"7 x plus 8 equals 0\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"x minus 4 equals 0\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Subtracting <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math> from both sides of the equation <math alttext=\"7 x plus 8 equals 0\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"7 x equals negative 8\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Dividing both sides of this equation by <math alttext=\"7\"><mn>7</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"x equals negative eight sevenths\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mfrac>\n\t\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t\t</mfrac>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Adding <math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math> to both sides of the equation <math alttext=\"x minus 4 equals 0\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"x equals 4\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>4</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Therefore, the two solutions to the given equation, <math alttext=\"7 x squared minus 20 x minus 32 equals 0\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t</msup>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>20</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>32</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, are <math alttext=\"negative eight sevenths\"><mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math>. It follows that <math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math> is the positive solution to the given equation.</p>",
